Unova_DriftveilCity_Z97_EventScript_Npc0_Text_0:
	.string "Well...\pThink it's about time to see fer myself\nwhat it is about yer skills that made a\l\lGym Leader like Elesa take such a\l\lshine to ya.$"

Unova_DriftveilCity_Z97_EventScript_Npc0_Text_1:
	.string "Mrrrmph. I see. But I sure don't like it!\pFer such a young 'un, ya have an imposin'\nbattle style.\pI know ya got people who can dig up\nyer potential.\pMrmph.\nHere! Take this!$"

Unova_DriftveilCity_Z97_EventScript_Npc0_Text_2:
	.string "{PLAYER} received the Quake Badge\nfrom Clay!$"

Unova_DriftveilCity_Z97_EventScript_Npc0_Text_3:
	.string "So this is yer fifth Badge, huh?\pIf that's so, Pokémon up to Lv. 60\nwill obey ya.\pAlso, I'll give ya this TM.\p...Well, that was the plan, but I just\nremembered there's somethin' I want.\pWait in front of the cave at the end of\nRoute 6, wouldja?$"

